      "type": "hook",
      "content": "Welcome to 'Cell - Structure and Functions'! Let's test your understanding with some hand-picked questions.",
      "content_hi": "'कोशिका - संरचना एवं कार्य' में आपका स्वागत है!आइए कुछ चुने हुए प्रश्नों के साथ आपकी समझ का परीक्षण करें।",
      "content_gu": "'સેલ - સ્ટ્રક્ચર એન્ડ ફંક્શન્સ' માં આપનું સ્વાગત છે!ચાલો કેટલાક હાથથી ચૂંટાયેલા પ્રશ્નો સાથે તમારી સમજણનું પરીક્ષણ કરીએ.",
      "body": "Welcome to 'Cell - Structure and Functions'! Let's test your understanding with some hand-picked questions.",
      "id": "KOBJ_NCERT_CLASS8_SCIENCE_CH8_HOOK_001"
    },
    {
      "type": "knowledge_check",
      "content": {
        "question": ": What is a push or pull on an object called?",
        "options": [
          "Pressure",
          "Energy",
          "Motion",
          "Force"
        ],
        "correct_answer": "Force",
        "explanation": "Correct answer as per the question bank."
      },
      "id": "KOBJ_NCERT_CLASS8_SCIENCE_CH8_KNOW_002"
    },
    {
      "type": "knowledge_check",
      "content": {
        "question": ": Which of the following can change the shape of an object?",
        "options": [
          "Friction",
          "Speed",
          "Force",
          "Heat"
        ],
        "correct_answer": "Force",
        "explanation": "Correct answer as per the question bank."
      },
      "id": "KOBJ_NCERT_CLASS8_SCIENCE_CH8_KNOW_003"
    },
    {
      "type": "knowledge_check",
      "content": {
        "question": ": Which of the following is a contact force?",
        "options": [
          "Gravitational force",
          "Friction",
          "Electrostatic force",
          "Magnetic force"
        ],
        "correct_answer": "Friction",
        "explanation": "Correct answer as per the question bank."
